cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "weather-informed-modeling: code for Weather-Informed Modeling of Renewable Electricity Share in Europe"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and analysis code for quantifying how much ERA5 weather adds to
  calendar-only models of hourly renewable generation as a share of national
  electricity load across 19 European countries, comparing capacity-weighted
  against uniform spatial aggregation at grid resolutions from 0.25 to 2 degrees.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/anacodicAI-labs/weather-informed-modeling"
keywords:
  - carbon neutrality
  - renewable electricity
  - weather-informed modeling
  - renewable energy mix
  - spatial resolution
  - capacity weighting
  - ERA5
  - European power systems
